>&#160;</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:7.9%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansByExercisePriceRangeAxis_tpcs_RangeOneMember_fNiOp-bMp0-v7Aps97YNkQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfOutstandingOptions" scale="0" id="Tc_K-aVQ7J0lUOaPmDIZkE9Pg_6_2">300,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:7.65%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansByExercisePriceRangeAxis_tpcs_RangeOneMember_JEaFiI6UjECLpkbvQbYWog" format="ixt-sec:duryear" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageRemainingContractualTerm2" id="Tc_ItyYuzxSpkaEgrpldYjtfw_6_4"> 1.24</ix:nonNumeric></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.25%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:7.75%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_abjrj8L7bkGWB-Gr0fn2rg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansByExercisePriceRangeAxis_tpcs_RangeOneMember_fNiOp-bMp0-v7Aps97YNkQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeOutstandingOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePriceBeginningBalance1" scale="0" id="Tc_Ftn2PzVnHkmyeuQgbjVcqg_6_7">2.11</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:7.69%;background:#cceeff;border-bottom:1px solid #000000;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansByExercisePriceRangeAxis_tpcs_RangeOneMember_fNiOp-bMp0-v7Aps97YNkQ" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeNumberOfExercisableOptions" scale="0" id="Tc_O8yyw3Npek2oxSQACF3FBQ_6_9">300,000</ix:nonFraction></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.48%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;"><span style="visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:1.25%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 0.05pt 0pt;">$</p></td><td style="vertical-align:bottom;white-space:nowrap;width:7.75%;background:#cceeff;margin:0pt;padding:0pt;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:right;margin:0pt 3pt 0.05pt 0pt;"> <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_abjrj8L7bkGWB-Gr0fn2rg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_ShareBasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansByExercisePriceRangeAxis_tpcs_RangeOneMember_fNiOp-bMp0-v7Aps97YNkQ" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharebasedCompensationSharesAuthorizedUnderStockOptionPlansExercisePriceRangeExercisableOptionsWeightedAverageExercisePrice1" scale="0" id="Tc_gesn0-pN7UK5usapJa1blA_6_12">2.11</ix:nonFraction></p></td></tr></table></ix:nonNumeric><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt;"><span style="margin-bottom:12pt;visibility:hidden;">&#8203;</span></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;"><i style="font-style:italic;">Stock Awards</i></p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On August 3, 2023, pursuant to the 2016 Plan, we issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_8_3_2023_To_8_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_GH7UzSJbGEGrdhLrM0-5fg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_dAxZTXY4nEmuVZchjf66Fw">15,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted common stock to our former chief financial officer. Under the terms of the employment agreement, provided employment with the Company continues from the grant date through the applicable vesting dates, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_8_3_2023_To_8_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_GH7UzSJbGEGrdhLrM0-5fg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="tpcs:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsToBeVestedOnEachAnniversary" scale="0" id="Narr_EopnYoXhAkWxygBwK7fq8g">5,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the restricted stock will vest on each of the first, second, and third anniversaries of the effective employment date of July 17, 2023. Fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_8_3_2023_To_8_3_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_GH7UzSJbGEGrdhLrM0-5fg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_RB14oItQG0Ge8QvX00lXyw">111</ix:nonFraction> was measured on the date of grant based on the number of shares expected to vest and the quoted market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock. Stock-based compensation expense will be recognized ratably over the vesting period. Total recognized compensation cost related to this award for the twelve months ended March 31, 2026 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_CwSc761xB0mZphsxvwm6zQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_-LliPpzcoEOJY8OHUxxrIw">37</ix:nonFraction>. There is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_vDF59iq7cE649dK9aG1oAw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_G2kDTj7rz0y_QPPltwBZgg">9</ix:nonFraction> of unrecognized compensation cost related to this award which is expected to be recognized over the next <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnAugust32023Member_CwSc761xB0mZphsxvwm6zQ" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_hsY8kRrh1EeCW0XyPjolFQ">three months</ix:nonNumeric>.</p></ix:continuation></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">51</p></div></div>
<div style="background-color:#000000;clear:both;height:2pt;page-break-after:always;width:88.24%;border:0;margin:30pt 5.88% 30pt 5.88%;"></div><div style="max-width:100%;padding-left:5.88%;padding-right:5.88%;position:relative;"><div style="margin-top:21.6pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;margin:0pt 0pt 30pt 0pt;"><a href="#TOC"><span style="font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">Table of Contents</span></a></p></div><div style="clear:both;max-width:100%;position:relative;"><ix:continuation id="Tb_KjWbbcBXikytYDBXoQl81Q_cont2"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On November 26, 2024, we issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_11_26_2023_To_11_26_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnNovember262024Member_RXwyWb1KfEusBUTFLLDoGw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_BwkB3IxpoU2K8H2zQiUjKg">45,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of restricted common stock to a former chief financial officer. Under the terms of the employment agreement, provided employment with the Company continues from the grant date through the applicable vesting dates, <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_11_26_2023_To_11_26_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnNovember262024Member_RXwyWb1KfEusBUTFLLDoGw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="tpcs:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsToBeVestedOnEachAnniversary" scale="0" id="Narr_VId56oB7ZkG7HHQws0farw">15,000</ix:nonFraction> shares of the restricted stock would vest on each of the first, second, and third anniversaries of the effective employment date of September 30, 2024. Fair value was measured on the date of grant, and total recognized compensation cost related to this award was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_11_26_2023_To_11_26_2023_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnNovember262024Member_RXwyWb1KfEusBUTFLLDoGw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_AlOkJBTpLEyRCH1cD4OX2A">21</ix:nonFraction>. Employment with the Company ended in February 2025. As such, all the shares were canceled and returned to the pool of shares authorized for issuance under the 2016 Plan.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On January 24, 2025, pursuant to the 2016 Plan, we awarded <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_83XmwJNCR0GROJ6rltbILg" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_ulLdtG2yK0ue2sKtx6voLw">54,880</ix:nonFraction> shares, in the aggregate, of restricted common stock to our <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_director_94RoJEnw4UOnhDe_RzIxCA" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_83XmwJNCR0GROJ6rltbILg" decimals="INF" format="ixt-sec:numwordsen" name="tpcs:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardNumberOfNonEmployeeDirectors" scale="0" id="Narr_q07Ht29l9UaI0DSV2u8otA">four</ix:nonFraction> non-employee directors. The common stock vested and become nonforfeitable on December 19, 2025. The grantee must have served as a director as of the vesting date and must have been continuously serving in such capacity from the grant date through the vesting date. During the period commencing on the grant date and ending on the vesting date, the grantee was not permitted to sell, transfer, pledge, assign or otherwise encumber the common stock. Fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_1_24_2025_To_1_24_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_83XmwJNCR0GROJ6rltbILg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_G01n7_gSpkyS9IDDRXrKGg">180</ix:nonFraction> was measured on the date of grant based on the number of shares expected to vest and the quoted market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock. Stock-based compensation expense was recognized ratably over the vesting period and total recognized compensation cost related to this award for the twelve months ended March 31, 2026 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedCommonStockAwardedOnJanuary242025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_0VHPhMewvk6aNBRr63IoTQ" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_HvdTosmeTU6AFKxemwQNRQ">135</ix:nonFraction>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 31, 2025, pursuant to the 2016 Plan, following the announcement of our newly appointed CFO, we agreed to grant in the amount of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_LoMHwueIL0C3X3ScMc6S8A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_PbjOJSV_ykiT-_Pqu2HXIQ">180</ix:nonFraction>, restricted shares of our common stock, or <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_LoMHwueIL0C3X3ScMc6S8A" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_Khu1ghMsrEyXcl4BP8T84g">78,261</ix:nonFraction> shares, based on the stock closing price of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Divide_USD_shares_abjrj8L7bkGWB-Gr0fn2rg" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_nC2ayMYMtkWR6e9AjOdR5g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:SharePrice" scale="0" id="Narr_HJGd9xtSsEKZJ8JA4AN-WQ">2.30</ix:nonFraction>. The fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_LoMHwueIL0C3X3ScMc6S8A" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_kgpzCE7cWEuyH66RggvcCA">180</ix:nonFraction> will be amortized ratably over a <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_3_31_2025_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_LoMHwueIL0C3X3ScMc6S8A" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardAwardVestingPeriod1" id="Narr_KGP9Nxw8okiM4wd0aJv_-Q">three-year</ix:nonNumeric> vesting period, following the transition date. Stock-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_Oc3PneJeHEOQpl4AeCjv6g" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_iW0KGCHP3EaU8PsbRpI3hQ">60</ix:nonFraction> was recognized for the twelve months ended March 31, 2026. There is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch312025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member__hJRt-itTUWdxLscmjCDag" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_gQwDFUt0ykSOWHSyBSEsdg">120</ix:nonFraction> of remaining unrecognized compensation cost under this award expected to be recognized over the next <span style="-sec-ix-hidden:Hidden_zUfFfB1MM0KrvtCcUph7gA;"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-style:normal;font-weight:normal;">twenty-four</span></span> months.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On October 2, 2025, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_10_2_2025_To_10_2_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnOctober22025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_ncZjONhusUuiBseBVfsApw" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_J5Ez01qLmU69q9B3AqxgiA">60,000</ix:nonFraction> shares, in the aggregate, of common stock to certain non-employee directors as compensation awards for services rendered in fiscal 2025 pursuant to agreements with each of the recipients. The shares immediately vested on the issue date and were subsequently registered with the SEC. The effectiveness date for the registration was December 11, 2025. Fair value of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_10_2_2025_To_10_2_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnOctober22025Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_ncZjONhusUuiBseBVfsApw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriodTotalFairValue" scale="3" id="Narr_l8UNUMGLs0emqDw3m8bnrA">314</ix:nonFraction> was measured on the date of issuance based on the number of shares vested and the quoted market price of the Company&#8217;s common stock.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">On March 6, 2026, pursuant to the 2016 Plan, the Company issued <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_3_6_2026_To_3_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_t420oeUH2UqgaaNAEiJF0g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsGrantsInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_hYyYHS5sxUSqH8L0mkVe2g">67,049</ix:nonFraction> shares, in the aggregate, of common stock to non-employee directors as compensation awards for services rendered in fiscal year 2026 pursuant to agreements with each of the recipients. There were <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="Duration_3_6_2026_To_3_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_t420oeUH2UqgaaNAEiJF0g" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsVestedInPeriod" scale="0" id="Narr_dO2znd44dUO_7krO450umg">18,137</ix:nonFraction> shares that were vested immediately, and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_shares_Eis3NMJq1E-lneDzpM2sRw" contextRef="As_Of_3_6_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_Ku2NCba62UWG47WgRyTpig" decimals="INF" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="tpcs:ShareBasedCompensationArrangementByShareBasedPaymentAwardEquityInstrumentsOtherThanOptionsToBeVestedOutstandingNumber" scale="0" id="Narr_VfTC-A1kTkSG37fXPht--w">48,912</ix:nonFraction> shares that will vest on October 28, 2026. Stock-based compensation expense of $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_aoPvC23FX0S5rRLMsW3FIA" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:AllocatedShareBasedCompensationExpense" scale="3" id="Narr_yTBm0_ENwE-O6Rc8sgYOCQ">89</ix:nonFraction> was recognized for the twelve months ended March 31, 2026. There is $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="As_Of_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_V3SgVj-NWUa-jQrXnPsgsw" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedShareBasedAwardsOtherThanOptions" scale="3" id="Narr_NIE4ZGeL_0CGL8uZ_xRY_A">157</ix:nonFraction> of remaining unrecognized compensation cost under this award expected to be recognized over the next <ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_tpcs_RestrictedStockIssuedOnMarch62026Member_us-gaap_PlanNameAxis_tpcs_EquityIncentivePlan2016Member_aoPvC23FX0S5rRLMsW3FIA" format="ixt-sec:durwordsen" name="us-gaap:EmployeeServiceShareBasedCompensationNonvestedAwardsTotalCompensationCostNotYetRecognizedPeriodForRecognition1" id="Narr_20sJ7mE1JUCXFt1ReLbbyg">six months</ix:nonNumeric>.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">The total recognized stock-based compensation cost related to all restricted stock awards for the fiscal year ended March 31, 2026 and 2025 was $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_y0O5OLkgg0STv3tHu5Mlcg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" scale="3" id="Narr__KeDmSvcnk2CX0beYEUzpg">635</ix:nonFraction> and $<ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_USD_mlaxq1N3WUy35Jhq-Tlu7Q" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_3_31_2025_us-gaap_AwardTypeAxis_us-gaap_RestrictedStockMember_1tsg95syhEmin8bk4qxEGg" decimals="-3" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ShareBasedCompensation" scale="3" id="Narr_KtmGT3e_fkaEfLENj8HprA">103</ix:nonFraction>, respectively.</p></ix:continuation><ix:nonNumeric contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026__w8y8gR3aUK2Vu5nrXgM2Q" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskDisclosureTextBlock" id="Tb_peiS8FbbPEm-sfioVLE9xA" continuedAt="Tb_peiS8FbbPEm-sfioVLE9xA_cont1" escape="true"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;font-weight:bold;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">NOTE&#160;8&#160;- CONCENTRATION OF RISK</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">We maintain bank account balances, which, at times, may exceed insured limits. We have not experienced any losses with these accounts and believe that we are not exposed to any significant credit risk with cash.</p><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:justify;margin:0pt 0pt 12pt 0pt;">For the fiscal years ended March 31, 2026 and 2025, one supplier accounted for <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5ygMhWSDEkyugazKamxPDA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2025_To_3_31_2026_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_tpcs_OneSupplierMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_Fwn31gTKgkWccmeJ8zfE8g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_9iezBNBfZEeG3a29xTxsIQ">34</ix:nonFraction>% and <ix:nonFraction unitRef="Unit_Standard_pure_5ygMhWSDEkyugazKamxPDA" contextRef="Duration_4_1_2024_To_3_31_2025_srt_MajorCustomersAxis_tpcs_OneSupplierMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByBenchmarkAxis_us-gaap_AccountsReceivableMember_us-gaap_ConcentrationRiskByTypeAxis_us-gaap_CustomerConcentrationRiskMember_smVgNOe8GEyGjBBEVW4q1g" decimals="2" format="ixt:num-dot-decimal" name="us-gaap:ConcentrationRiskPercentage1" scale="-2" id="Narr_eNhVM5efn0qZa3Zg6v_m8g">27</ix:nonFraction>%, respectively, of our purchased material.</p></ix:nonNumeric></div><div style="clear:both;margin-bottom:30pt;width:100%;"><p style="font-family:'Times New Roman','Times','serif';font-size:10pt;text-align:center;margin:24pt 0pt 0pt 0pt;">52</p></div></div>
